concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-3-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedules"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  (2) The provisions of the Carrier Licence Conditions (Networks supplying Superfast Carriage Services to Residential Customers) Declaration 2014 amended or inserted by this Act, and any other provisions of that instrument, may be varied by an instrument made under subsection 63(5) of the Telecommunications Act 1997, or revoked by an instrument made under subsection 63(6) of that Act (see subsection 13(5) of the Legislation Act 2003).  (3) The provisions of the Legislation (Exemptions and Other Matters) Regulation 2015 amended or inserted by this Act, and any other provisions of that instrument, may be amended or repealed by regulations made under section 62 of the Legislation Act 2003 (see subsection 13(5) of the Legislation Act 2003)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  (2) The provisions of the Carrier Licence Conditions (Networks supplying Superfast Carriage Services to Residential Customers) Declaration 2014 amended or inserted by this Act, and any other provisions of that instrument, may be varied by an instrument made under subsection 63(5) of the Telecommunications Act 1997, or revoked by an instrument made under subsection 63(6) of that Act (see subsection 13(5) of the Legislation Act 2003).  (3) The provisions of the Legislation (Exemptions and Other Matters) Regulation 2015 amended or inserted by this Act, and any other provisions of that instrument, may be amended or repealed by regulations made under section 62 of the Legislation Act 2003 (see subsection 13(5) of the Legislation Act 2003)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8622c070fce93e39fd4f38aa67f7e4d0fff8360a0b5213862561a48f10507911" ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-3-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-3-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-3-2-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
