concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-4-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Transitional—election to be bound by deemed standard functional"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4-2 ;
    values:originalText "separation undertaking  If:  (a) in accordance with section 4 of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901, a determination is made under subsection 151B(1) of the Telecommunications Act 1997 before the commencement of Schedule 2 to this Act; and  (b) a corporation is included in a class of corporations specified in the determination; the corporation may, before the commencement of that Schedule, give an election to be bound by the determination." ;
    skos:definition "separation undertaking  If:  (a) in accordance with section 4 of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901, a determination is made under subsection 151B(1) of the Telecommunications Act 1997 before the commencement of Schedule 2 to this Act; and  (b) a corporation is included in a class of corporations specified in the determination; the corporation may, before the commencement of that Schedule, give an election to be bound by the determination."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c9fe4a64035c502085003d6ec3edb39d0d06eb80dabf0cb3e5c17bd46f779040" ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Election to be bound by deemed standard functional determination" ;
