concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5(6) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5-2-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Without limiting paragraph (5)(b), the following are changes that must be taken into account in updating the inputs and assumptions:  (a) changes in the inputs for estimating the total number of chargeable premises by reference to which charge is imposed by the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act;  (b) changes in the inputs for build costs in relation to fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband matters;  (c) changes in the inputs for estimating future capital expenditure requirements in relation to fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband matters." ;
    skos:definition "(6) Without limiting paragraph (5)(b), the following are changes that must be taken into account in updating the inputs and assumptions:  (a) changes in the inputs for estimating the total number of chargeable premises by reference to which charge is imposed by the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act;  (b) changes in the inputs for build costs in relation to fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband matters;  (c) changes in the inputs for estimating future capital expenditure requirements in relation to fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband matters."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a92d1b271be7834d09655c0c4835178e65d24442b247be2c8af569dd7d6e49e3" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must consider changes in inputs for estimating chargeable premises and build costs." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
