concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5(7) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5-2-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) In preparing the report, the ACCC must assume that Division 6 of Part 3 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999 had not been enacted. Note: That Division deals with charge offset certificates." ;
    skos:definition "(7) In preparing the report, the ACCC must assume that Division 6 of Part 3 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999 had not been enacted. Note: That Division deals with charge offset certificates."@en ;
