doc:sec-5-2-ss-9 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "5(9) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(9) The Minister must cause a copy of the report to be tabled in each House of the Parliament within 5 sitting days of receiving it. Use of the word “Regional”" ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5(10) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5-2-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) To avoid doubt, the use of the word “Regional” in this section does not limit:  (a) subsection 80(1) of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999; or  (b) subsection 13(3) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act. Definitions" ;
    skos:definition "(10) To avoid doubt, the use of the word “Regional” in this section does not limit:  (a) subsection 80(1) of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999; or  (b) subsection 13(3) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act. Definitions"@en ;
