concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2-ss-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5(11) Modelling of Regional Broadband Scheme"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-5-2-ss-11 ;
    values:originalText "(11) In this section: fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband matters means the matters referred to in paragraphs 13(3)(a) to (d) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act. Minister means the Minister administering the Telecommunications Act 1997. NBN Co has the same meaning as in the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011. Regional Broadband Scheme means the scheme embodied in:  (a) Part 3 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999; and  (b) the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act. Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act means the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020.  Layer 2 bitstream services  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(11) In this section: fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband matters means the matters referred to in paragraphs 13(3)(a) to (d) of the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act. Minister means the Minister administering the Telecommunications Act 1997. NBN Co has the same meaning as in the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011. Regional Broadband Scheme means the scheme embodied in:  (a) Part 3 of the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999; and  (b) the Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act. Regional Broadband Scheme Charge Act means the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020.  Layer 2 bitstream services  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4cde248f04cfb5f14eea2da6388f1b54d3e1a1cb87f5d7a167481f8f2104e82f" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sec-5-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definitions for Regional Broadband Scheme" ;
