concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Section 5"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "Omit “residential customers.”, substitute:  residential customers, and:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) the network came into existence before the designated commencement date; and  (b) the network has not been altered, upgraded or extended on or after the designated commencement date; and  (c) no functional separation undertaking given by the carrier is in force." ;
    skos:definition "Omit “residential customers.”, substitute:  residential customers, and:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) the network came into existence before the designated commencement date; and  (b) the network has not been altered, upgraded or extended on or after the designated commencement date; and  (c) no functional separation undertaking given by the carrier is in force."@en ;
