    values:originalText "Add:  (2) A reference in paragraph (1)(c) to a functional separation undertaking given by a carrier is a reference to a functional separation undertaking given by the carrier either:  (a) alone; or  (b) jointly with one or more other persons. Competition and Consumer Act 2010" ;
