concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-142bd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "142BD Designated carriage service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-142bd ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, designated carriage service means:  (a) if a carriage service is specified in an instrument under subsection (2)—that carriage service; or  (b) otherwise—a Layer 2 bitstream service.  (2) The ACCC may, by legislative instrument, specify a carriage service for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a).  (3) The ACCC must not specify a carriage service under subsection (2) unless:  (a) the carriage service enables end-users to download communications; and  (b) the download transmission speed of the carriage service is normally 25 megabits per second or more; and  (c) the carriage service is supplied using a line to premises occupied or used by an end-user; and  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (d) there is in force a declaration under subsection 152AL(3) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 that relates to the carriage service." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Part, designated carriage service means:  (a) if a carriage service is specified in an instrument under subsection (2)—that carriage service; or  (b) otherwise—a Layer 2 bitstream service.  (2) The ACCC may, by legislative instrument, specify a carriage service for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a).  (3) The ACCC must not specify a carriage service under subsection (2) unless:  (a) the carriage service enables end-users to download communications; and  (b) the download transmission speed of the carriage service is normally 25 megabits per second or more; and  (c) the carriage service is supplied using a line to premises occupied or used by an end-user; and  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (d) there is in force a declaration under subsection 152AL(3) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 that relates to the carriage service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d279e7c2b35f7c527163c03881ce0143d0f257411cd8a2bc4a03fe2021419f20" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer ;
