doc:sch-2-sec-142c-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "142C(2) Supply of eligible services to be on wholesale basis—lines that" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If a person (the first person):  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  (a) is in a position to exercise control of the line; or  (b) is an associate of a person who is in a position to exercise control of the line; the first person must not, on or after the designated commencement date, use the line, either alone or jointly with one or more other persons, to supply an eligible service unless the service is supplied to:  (c) a carrier; or  (d) a service provider. Note: For when a person is in a position to exercise control of a line, see section 155A." ;
    cof:pageNumber "25"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-142c-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "142C(3) Supply of eligible services to be on wholesale basis—lines that"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-142c-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to the use of the line if a functional separation undertaking given by the first person is in force, unless:  (a) the ACCC has given a notice under section 151W revoking the undertaking; and  (b) the revocation has not taken effect; and  (c) the line came into existence after the notice was given. Note 1: A functional separation undertaking relates to the supply of eligible services using a local access line, irrespective of when the line came into existence. Note 2: See also section 142B. Ancillary contraventions" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to the use of the line if a functional separation undertaking given by the first person is in force, unless:  (a) the ACCC has given a notice under section 151W revoking the undertaking; and  (b) the revocation has not taken effect; and  (c) the line came into existence after the notice was given. Note 1: A functional separation undertaking relates to the supply of eligible services using a local access line, irrespective of when the line came into existence. Note 2: See also section 142B. Ancillary contraventions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6622be8bb6d684a6dd4948ffcbc9108f9f51d78a555c38fe37e8daf62fe03020" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-142c ;
    cof:pageNumber "25"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from subsection (2) for functional separation undertakings" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
