    cof:title "142C(5) Supply of eligible services to be on wholesale basis—lines that" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsections (2) and (4) are civil penalty provisions.  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions." ;
