doc:sch-2-sec-41-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "41(3) Subsections 143(2) and (3)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to the use of the line if a functional separation undertaking given by the first person is in force, unless:  (a) the ACCC has given a notice under section 151W revoking the undertaking; and  (b) the revocation has not taken effect; and  (c) the line came into existence after the notice was given. Note 1: A functional separation undertaking relates to the supply of eligible services using a local access line, irrespective of when the line came into existence. Note 2: See also section 142B." ;
