concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143a-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143A(8) Class exemptions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-143a-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) In deciding whether to make a determination under subsection (1) or (2), the ACCC must have regard to:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) whether the determination promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services; and  (b) the matters (if any) specified in a determination under subsection (9); and  (c) such other matters (if any) as the ACCC considers relevant." ;
    skos:definition "(8) In deciding whether to make a determination under subsection (1) or (2), the ACCC must have regard to:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) whether the determination promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services; and  (b) the matters (if any) specified in a determination under subsection (9); and  (c) such other matters (if any) as the ACCC considers relevant."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "08a43fc1cde251d37016849d2e22a9e1e65186e4baac86e0ad64418f7fca1ef0" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143a ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consider long-term interests of end-users and specified matters when making a determination." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
