concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143a-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143A(10) Class exemptions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-143a-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) For the purposes of this section, if:  (a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:  (i) a local access line; or  (ii) a telecommunications network; and  (b) the person has one or more associates; then:  (c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and  (d) the associated group consists of the person and those associates." ;
    skos:definition "(10) For the purposes of this section, if:  (a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:  (i) a local access line; or  (ii) a telecommunications network; and  (b) the person has one or more associates; then:  (c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and  (d) the associated group consists of the person and those associates."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e13195691be23f157d85864d3c40f8d38c7dbd2f5643224bd80071f6ec6ebb31" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143a ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Definition of associated group for control purposes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
