concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143B Compliance with conditions and limitations of exemption"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-143b ;
    values:originalText "determinations  (1) A person must, on or after the designated commencement date, comply with the conditions or limitations of a determination under subsection 143A(1) or (2). Ancillary contraventions  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1). Civil penalty provisions  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions." ;
    skos:definition "determinations  (1) A person must, on or after the designated commencement date, comply with the conditions or limitations of a determination under subsection 143A(1) or (2). Ancillary contraventions  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1). Civil penalty provisions  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "81b25ffd53c8b123485f6ba8ad7becc05475989d703d8f235d88afe6ee5b712a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "33"^^xsd:integer ;
