concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143B(3) Compliance with conditions and limitations of exemption"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-143b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions." ;
