concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143d-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143D(9) Publication of list of persons who have elected to be bound by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-143d-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) For the purposes of this section, a project is a building redevelopment project if the project involves:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) the significant refurbishment or repurposing of one or more buildings so as to bring into existence one or more building units; and  (b) the making available of any or all of those building units for sale or lease." ;
    skos:definition "(9) For the purposes of this section, a project is a building redevelopment project if the project involves:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) the significant refurbishment or repurposing of one or more buildings so as to bring into existence one or more building units; and  (b) the making available of any or all of those building units for sale or lease."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bf18eb8d9b6276653b6cdddeb3ae67ba1685279fa933e60bf0d9dabd7fc83b41" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143d ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines a building redevelopment project" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf> ;
