concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143d-ss-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143D(11) Publication of list of persons who have elected to be bound by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-143d-ss-11 ;
    values:originalText "(11) For the purposes of subsection (9), it is immaterial whether:  (a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in stages; or  (b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will be, carried out by different persons; or  (c) one or more approvals are given, are required, or will be required, under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, for the project, or any element of the project." ;
    skos:definition "(11) For the purposes of subsection (9), it is immaterial whether:  (a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in stages; or  (b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will be, carried out by different persons; or  (c) one or more approvals are given, are required, or will be required, under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, for the project, or any element of the project."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "300727503f18c993c04902b6049a4d229a6061f1b10930d4a31651827eb72c42" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143d ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "It is immaterial whether the project has been, is being, or will be implemented in stages." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf> ;
