concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143f-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143f-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2 .
