doc:sch-2-sec-143g-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "143G(4) Exemptions—networks covered by exemption instruments" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If:  (a) the Telecommunications (Network Exemption—Specified Velocity Networks) Instrument 2012 was in force at the start of the designated commencement date; and  (b) a line came into existence on or after the designated commencement date; and  (c) the line forms part of the infrastructure of a Specified Velocity Network (within the meaning of that instrument); and  (d) that instrument has not ceased to be in force; the line is exempt from section 142C. Note 1: See also section 156A (certain lines deemed to have come into existence on or after the designated commencement date). Note 2: See also section 158A (certain line extensions deemed to be local access lines in their own right, and to have come into existence on or after the designated commencement date)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143g-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "143G(5) Exemptions—networks covered by exemption instruments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-143g-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) For the purposes of paragraph (4)(c) of this section, assume that paragraph (c) of the definition of Specified Velocity Network in the Telecommunications (Network Exemption—Specified Velocity Networks) Instrument 2012 were modified by omitting all the words from and including “in accordance with” to and including “project”." ;
    skos:definition "(5) For the purposes of paragraph (4)(c) of this section, assume that paragraph (c) of the definition of Specified Velocity Network in the Telecommunications (Network Exemption—Specified Velocity Networks) Instrument 2012 were modified by omitting all the words from and including “in accordance with” to and including “project”."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b5fc077bb07ec97c5af2c245bcd74a5c7800227d92133e31a95bef73d683e24f" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143g ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Assume modified definition of Specified Velocity Network" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.38" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-143g-ss-5-norm .
