concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-43 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "43 At the end of section 144"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-43 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (7) The Minister must not make an instrument under subsection (1), (2) or (3) on or after the designated commencement date.  (8) Subsection (7) does not prevent the Minister from varying an instrument that was in force immediately after the start of the designated commencement date." ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (7) The Minister must not make an instrument under subsection (1), (2) or (3) on or after the designated commencement date.  (8) Subsection (7) does not prevent the Minister from varying an instrument that was in force immediately after the start of the designated commencement date."@en ;
