concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151A(4) Standard functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The undertaking must:  (a) be in a form approved in writing by the ACCC; and  (b) be accompanied by such information as is reasonably likely to assist the ACCC to decide whether to accept or reject the undertaking; and  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (c) be accompanied by the fee (if any) specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, a determination under subsection (16). Expiry time" ;
