concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151a-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151A(10) Standard functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151a-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) The undertaking must provide that the person will give the ACCC periodic reports (to be known as compliance reports) that:  (a) relate to the person’s compliance with the undertaking; and  (b) are in a form approved in writing by the ACCC. Note: See section 151ZJ (self-incrimination). Compliance plans" ;
    skos:definition "(10) The undertaking must provide that the person will give the ACCC periodic reports (to be known as compliance reports) that:  (a) relate to the person’s compliance with the undertaking; and  (b) are in a form approved in writing by the ACCC. Note: See section 151ZJ (self-incrimination). Compliance plans"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "71bfbef8cc8f9bf0f919b6aec60ca556a580135845e8c59908a18bd5eedeb26a" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151a ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The undertaking must provide periodic reports to the ACCC." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
