concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151a-ss-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151A(11) Standard functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151a-ss-11 ;
    values:originalText "(11) The undertaking must provide that the person will:  (a) prepare a plan (to be known as a compliance plan) setting out the actions to be taken by the person for the purpose of ensuring that the person complies with the undertaking; and  (b) give the ACCC:  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  (i) a copy of the compliance plan; and  (ii) a copy of any variation of the compliance plan. ACCC may perform functions or exercise powers" ;
    skos:definition "(11) The undertaking must provide that the person will:  (a) prepare a plan (to be known as a compliance plan) setting out the actions to be taken by the person for the purpose of ensuring that the person complies with the undertaking; and  (b) give the ACCC:  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  (i) a copy of the compliance plan; and  (ii) a copy of any variation of the compliance plan. ACCC may perform functions or exercise powers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5fa7a16ffc0644ede5a20156e018270730a79ce37390fc5dc7bf90407ea2e9bf" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151a ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The undertaking must provide a compliance plan and notify the ACCC of any variations." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
