doc:sch-2-sec-151c-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151C(4) Joint functional separation undertaking" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The undertaking must:  (a) be in a form approved in writing by the ACCC; and  (b) be accompanied by such information as is reasonably likely to assist the ACCC to decide whether to accept or reject the undertaking; and  (c) be accompanied by the fee (if any) specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, a determination under subsection (18).  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  Expiry time" ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer .

