concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151c-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151C(9) Joint functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151c-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) The undertaking:  (a) must state that the provisions of the undertaking covered by paragraphs (2)(a), (b), (c), (h), (i), (k), (l), (m), (n), (o) and (p) are fundamental provisions; and  (b) may state that one or more other provisions of the undertaking are fundamental provisions. Compliance reports" ;
    skos:definition "(9) The undertaking:  (a) must state that the provisions of the undertaking covered by paragraphs (2)(a), (b), (c), (h), (i), (k), (l), (m), (n), (o) and (p) are fundamental provisions; and  (b) may state that one or more other provisions of the undertaking are fundamental provisions. Compliance reports"@en ;
