concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151c-ss-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151C(12) Joint functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151c-ss-12 ;
    values:originalText "(12) The undertaking must provide that a wholesaler will:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) prepare a plan (to be known as a compliance plan) setting out the actions to be taken by the wholesaler for the purpose of ensuring that the wholesaler complies with the undertaking; and  (b) give the ACCC:  (i) a copy of the compliance plan; and  (ii) a copy of any variation of the compliance plan." ;
    skos:definition "(12) The undertaking must provide that a wholesaler will:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) prepare a plan (to be known as a compliance plan) setting out the actions to be taken by the wholesaler for the purpose of ensuring that the wholesaler complies with the undertaking; and  (b) give the ACCC:  (i) a copy of the compliance plan; and  (ii) a copy of any variation of the compliance plan."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "394b3ff43935d76593032fb252979b6002224843e72fe249baf6122e1fc9c237" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151c ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Wholesaler must prepare a compliance plan and provide it to the ACCC." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
