doc:sch-2-sec-151c-ss-12 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151C(12) Joint functional separation undertaking" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(12) The undertaking must provide that a wholesaler will:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) prepare a plan (to be known as a compliance plan) setting out the actions to be taken by the wholesaler for the purpose of ensuring that the wholesaler complies with the undertaking; and  (b) give the ACCC:  (i) a copy of the compliance plan; and  (ii) a copy of any variation of the compliance plan." ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151c-ss-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151C(13) Joint functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151c-ss-13 ;
    values:originalText "(13) The undertaking must provide that a retailer will:  (a) prepare a plan (to be known as a compliance plan) setting out the actions to be taken by the retailer for the purpose of ensuring that the retailer complies with the undertaking; and  (b) give the ACCC:  (i) a copy of the compliance plan; and  (ii) a copy of any variation of the compliance plan. ACCC may perform functions or exercise powers" ;
    skos:definition "(13) The undertaking must provide that a retailer will:  (a) prepare a plan (to be known as a compliance plan) setting out the actions to be taken by the retailer for the purpose of ensuring that the retailer complies with the undertaking; and  (b) give the ACCC:  (i) a copy of the compliance plan; and  (ii) a copy of any variation of the compliance plan. ACCC may perform functions or exercise powers"@en ;
