concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151c-ss-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151C(14) Joint functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151c-ss-14 ;
    values:originalText "(14) If the undertaking provides for the ACCC to perform functions or exercise powers in relation to the undertaking, the ACCC may perform those functions, and exercise those powers, in accordance with the undertaking. Determinations" ;
