concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151E Withdrawal of undertaking that is under consideration"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151e ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This section applies if:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a standard functional separation undertaking; or  (b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a joint functional separation undertaking. Withdrawal  (2) The person or persons may withdraw the undertaking at any time before the ACCC makes a decision to accept or reject the undertaking.  (3) This Act does not prevent the person or persons from giving a fresh undertaking.  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  Refund of fee  (4) If:  (a) the person or persons withdraw the undertaking; and  (b) the person or persons have paid a fee in relation to the undertaking; the ACCC may, on behalf of the Commonwealth, refund the whole or a part of the fee." ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This section applies if:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a standard functional separation undertaking; or  (b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a joint functional separation undertaking. Withdrawal  (2) The person or persons may withdraw the undertaking at any time before the ACCC makes a decision to accept or reject the undertaking.  (3) This Act does not prevent the person or persons from giving a fresh undertaking.  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  Refund of fee  (4) If:  (a) the person or persons withdraw the undertaking; and  (b) the person or persons have paid a fee in relation to the undertaking; the ACCC may, on behalf of the Commonwealth, refund the whole or a part of the fee."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "54"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151e-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151e-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151e-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151e-ss-4 ;
