doc:sch-2-sec-151f-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151F(4) ACCC to accept or reject functional separation undertaking" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the ACCC rejects the undertaking, the ACCC must give the person or persons a written notice:  (a) stating that the undertaking has been rejected; and  (b) setting out the reasons for the rejection. ACCC to make decision within 3 months" ;
    cof:pageNumber "55"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151f-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151F(5) ACCC to accept or reject functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151f-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The ACCC must take all reasonable steps to ensure that a decision about the undertaking is made under subsection (2) within 3 months after receiving the undertaking.  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(5) The ACCC must take all reasonable steps to ensure that a decision about the undertaking is made under subsection (2) within 3 months after receiving the undertaking.  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "df30779d301eaee46e12c55125573b6ba018f47c1bc70c524efb94ff71287b06" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151f ;
    cof:pageNumber "55"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "ACCC must take steps to ensure a decision is made within 3 months after receiving the undertaking." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
