    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a standard functional separation undertaking (the first functional separation undertaking); and  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  (b) the ACCC rejects the first functional separation undertaking; and  (c) the person subsequently gives the ACCC another standard functional separation undertaking; and  (d) the ACCC is satisfied that any or all of the provisions of the first functional separation undertaking are materially similar to any or all of the provisions of the other functional separation undertaking; the ACCC may refuse to consider the other functional separation undertaking." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a standard functional separation undertaking (the first functional separation undertaking); and  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  (b) the ACCC rejects the first functional separation undertaking; and  (c) the person subsequently gives the ACCC another standard functional separation undertaking; and  (d) the ACCC is satisfied that any or all of the provisions of the first functional separation undertaking are materially similar to any or all of the provisions of the other functional separation undertaking; the ACCC may refuse to consider the other functional separation undertaking."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2465b08118d0713f6e4e82287903aa3be420efd3540adedede99861174386139" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151h ;
    cof:pageNumber "57"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "ACCC may refuse to consider another functional separation undertaking if it is materially similar to a previous one." ;
