doc:sch-2-sec-151k-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151K(1) Variation of functional separation undertaking that is under" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a standard functional separation undertaking (the original undertaking); or  (b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a joint functional separation undertaking (the original undertaking). Notice" ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151k-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151K(2) Variation of functional separation undertaking that is under"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151k-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The ACCC may give the person or persons a written notice stating that, if:  (a) the person makes, or the persons make, such variations to the original undertaking as are specified in the notice; and  (b) the person gives, or the persons give, the varied undertaking to the ACCC within the period specified in the notice;  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  the ACCC will consider the varied undertaking under section 151F as if the varied undertaking had been given to the ACCC instead of the original undertaking. Treatment of varied undertaking" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The ACCC may give the person or persons a written notice stating that, if:  (a) the person makes, or the persons make, such variations to the original undertaking as are specified in the notice; and  (b) the person gives, or the persons give, the varied undertaking to the ACCC within the period specified in the notice;  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  the ACCC will consider the varied undertaking under section 151F as if the varied undertaking had been given to the ACCC instead of the original undertaking. Treatment of varied undertaking"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8a378461883dd0cf0bd7de5f1defacda7f9ebd23c6b9165f6a64d55b91de1029" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151k ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The ACCC must consider a varied undertaking under section 151F as if it had been given instead of the original undertaking." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
