doc:sch-2-sec-151k-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151K(2) Variation of functional separation undertaking that is under" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The ACCC may give the person or persons a written notice stating that, if:  (a) the person makes, or the persons make, such variations to the original undertaking as are specified in the notice; and  (b) the person gives, or the persons give, the varied undertaking to the ACCC within the period specified in the notice;  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  the ACCC will consider the varied undertaking under section 151F as if the varied undertaking had been given to the ACCC instead of the original undertaking. Treatment of varied undertaking" ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151k-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151K(3) Variation of functional separation undertaking that is under"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151k-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the person gives, or the persons give, the ACCC a varied undertaking in response to the notice, the ACCC must consider the varied undertaking under section 151F as if the varied undertaking had been given to the ACCC instead of the original undertaking. No duty to consider whether to give a notice" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the person gives, or the persons give, the ACCC a varied undertaking in response to the notice, the ACCC must consider the varied undertaking under section 151F as if the varied undertaking had been given to the ACCC instead of the original undertaking. No duty to consider whether to give a notice"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a93d9a6c05928fae7cd85fc158341fe3b922addf4aafed398e28c14c9683cb01" ;
