concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151L Replacement of functional separation undertaking that is"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151l ;
    values:originalText "under consideration Scope  (1) This section applies if a person gives the ACCC a standard functional separation undertaking (the original undertaking). Notice  (2) The ACCC may give the person a written notice stating that, if:  (a) the person withdraws the original undertaking; and  (b) the person, together with one or more other persons specified in the notice, gives a joint functional separation undertaking in the terms specified in the notice; and  (c) the person does the things mentioned in paragraphs (a) and (b) within the time limit specified in the notice; the ACCC would be inclined to accept the joint functional separation undertaking.  (3) The ACCC does not have a duty to consider whether to give a notice under subsection (2).  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020" ;
    skos:definition "under consideration Scope  (1) This section applies if a person gives the ACCC a standard functional separation undertaking (the original undertaking). Notice  (2) The ACCC may give the person a written notice stating that, if:  (a) the person withdraws the original undertaking; and  (b) the person, together with one or more other persons specified in the notice, gives a joint functional separation undertaking in the terms specified in the notice; and  (c) the person does the things mentioned in paragraphs (a) and (b) within the time limit specified in the notice; the ACCC would be inclined to accept the joint functional separation undertaking.  (3) The ACCC does not have a duty to consider whether to give a notice under subsection (2).  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eda1d2628ecedd8a2abfe90aece4cd94960dd00fafb42253be327a605107153c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151l-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151l-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151l-ss-3 ;
