concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151n-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151N(7) Variation of expiry time of certain functional separation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151n-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) Before making a decision under this section to vary a functional separation undertaking, the ACCC must:  (a) publish on the ACCC’s website a notice:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (i) setting out the proposed variation; and  (ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC about the proposed variation within the time limit specified in the notice; and  (b) consider any submissions received within the time limit specified in the notice." ;
    skos:definition "(7) Before making a decision under this section to vary a functional separation undertaking, the ACCC must:  (a) publish on the ACCC’s website a notice:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (i) setting out the proposed variation; and  (ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the ACCC about the proposed variation within the time limit specified in the notice; and  (b) consider any submissions received within the time limit specified in the notice."@en ;
