doc:sch-2-sec-151q-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151Q(4) Variation of functional separation undertaking that is in force" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the undertaking is a joint functional separation undertaking, the undertaking as varied must comply with subsections 151C(2), (5), (8), (9), (10), (11), (12) and (13) and paragraph 151C(4)(a). Form etc." ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151q-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151Q(5) Variation of functional separation undertaking that is in force"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151q-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The variation must:  (a) be accompanied by such information as is reasonably likely to assist the ACCC to decide whether to accept or reject the variation; and  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (b) be accompanied by the fee (if any) specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, a determination under subsection (6)." ;
    skos:definition "(5) The variation must:  (a) be accompanied by such information as is reasonably likely to assist the ACCC to decide whether to accept or reject the variation; and  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (b) be accompanied by the fee (if any) specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, a determination under subsection (6)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6841da137db2edce320ab6af892cbfa5b5bd861e145ea710ec053d04b61b3515" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151q ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must provide information and fee for variation of functional separation undertaking" ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
