doc:sch-2-sec-151t-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151T(7) ACCC to accept or reject variation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) The ACCC may, by written notice given to the person or persons, extend the 3-month period referred to in subsection (5) (the initial 3-month period), so long as:  (a) the extension is for a period of not more than 3 months; and  (b) the notice includes a statement explaining why the ACCC has been unable to make a decision on the variation within the initial 3-month period." ;
    cof:pageNumber "66"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151t-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151T(8) ACCC to accept or reject variation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151t-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) As soon as practicable after the ACCC gives a notice under subsection (7), the ACCC must publish a copy of the notice on the ACCC’s website.  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(8) As soon as practicable after the ACCC gives a notice under subsection (7), the ACCC must publish a copy of the notice on the ACCC’s website.  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9f66b580f5a363994dd8d85bb48f064d6ddabaeb656a7b99f6adb94885676aa9" ;
