concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151v a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151V Criteria for accepting variation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151v ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This section applies if:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a variation of a standard functional separation undertaking; or  (b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a variation of a joint functional separation undertaking. Criteria  (2) In deciding whether to accept the variation, the ACCC must have regard to:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) whether the variation promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services; and  (b) the matters (if any) specified in a determination under subsection (3); and  (c) such other matters (if any) as the ACCC considers relevant.  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine one or more matters for the purposes of paragraph (2)(b)." ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This section applies if:  (a) a person gives the ACCC a variation of a standard functional separation undertaking; or  (b) 2 or more persons give the ACCC a variation of a joint functional separation undertaking. Criteria  (2) In deciding whether to accept the variation, the ACCC must have regard to:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) whether the variation promotes the long-term interests of end-users of carriage services or of services supplied by means of carriage services; and  (b) the matters (if any) specified in a determination under subsection (3); and  (c) such other matters (if any) as the ACCC considers relevant.  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine one or more matters for the purposes of paragraph (2)(b)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "68"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151v-ss-1 ;
