concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151w-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151W(3) Revocation of functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151w-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) a standard functional separation undertaking given by a person is in force; and  (b) the person requests the ACCC, in writing, to revoke the undertaking; the ACCC must, by written notice given to the person, revoke the undertaking.  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If:  (a) a standard functional separation undertaking given by a person is in force; and  (b) the person requests the ACCC, in writing, to revoke the undertaking; the ACCC must, by written notice given to the person, revoke the undertaking.  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "14ac4d0b32dc9dd8e85ada01b90d4ec1394ef7c9aaa41df1a095dd2d99233a20" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151w ;
    cof:pageNumber "69"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The ACCC must revoke a standard functional separation undertaking upon request." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
