concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151w-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151W(8) Revocation of functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151w-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) If:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) a joint functional separation undertaking given by 2 or more persons is in force; and  (b) those persons request the ACCC, in writing, to revoke the undertaking; the ACCC must, by written notice given to each of those persons, revoke the undertaking." ;
