    cof:title "151X(2) Consultation—revocation of functional separation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The time limit must not be shorter than 15 business days after the notice is given. Revocation of joint functional separation undertaking" ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151x-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151X(3) Consultation—revocation of functional separation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151x-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Before making a decision under subsection 151W(6) or (7) to revoke a joint functional separation undertaking given by 2 or more persons, the ACCC must:  (a) give each of those persons a written notice:  (i) stating that the ACCC proposes to revoke the undertaking; and  (ii) inviting those persons to make submissions to the ACCC about the revocation within the time limit specified in the notice; and  (b) consider any submissions received within the time limit specified in the notice." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Before making a decision under subsection 151W(6) or (7) to revoke a joint functional separation undertaking given by 2 or more persons, the ACCC must:  (a) give each of those persons a written notice:  (i) stating that the ACCC proposes to revoke the undertaking; and  (ii) inviting those persons to make submissions to the ACCC about the revocation within the time limit specified in the notice; and  (b) consider any submissions received within the time limit specified in the notice."@en ;
