doc:sch-2-sec-151za-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151ZA(4) Reporting obligations following giving of revocation notice" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (3); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (3); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (3); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (3). Civil penalty provisions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151za-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZA(5) Reporting obligations following giving of revocation notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151za-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsections (3) and (4) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions.  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Subsections (3) and (4) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions.  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d4d971f5632f6156e836ee6fb9b51caaa82b793cf7df46463fa10eb9769aa66b" ;
