doc:sch-2-sec-151zb-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151ZB(4) Requirement to notify changes in control of person who gave" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The notice must be in a form approved, in writing, by the ACCC.  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  Ancillary contraventions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "77"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zb-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZB(5) Requirement to notify changes in control of person who gave"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zb-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1) or (3); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1) or (3); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1) or (3); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1) or (3). Civil penalty provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(5) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1) or (3); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1) or (3); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1) or (3); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1) or (3). Civil penalty provisions"@en ;
