concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zd a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZD Compliance with functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zd ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a functional separation undertaking given by a person is in force, the person must comply with the undertaking.  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  Note: See also section 142B. Ancillary contraventions  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1). Civil penalty provisions  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If a functional separation undertaking given by a person is in force, the person must comply with the undertaking.  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  Note: See also section 142B. Ancillary contraventions  (2) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1). Civil penalty provisions  (3) Subsections (1) and (2) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c0753a069883281f23ee97b523b2eb9766671737b672c0cf23197b26cdd979a0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zd-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zd-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zd-ss-3 ;
