doc:sch-2-sec-151zf-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151ZF(5) Eligible services to be supplied on a non-discriminatory basis" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1) or (4); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1) or (4); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1) or (4); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1) or (4). Civil penalty provisions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zf-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZF(6) Eligible services to be supplied on a non-discriminatory basis"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zf-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Subsections (1), (4) and (5) are civil penalty provisions. Note: Part 31 provides for pecuniary penalties for breaches of civil penalty provisions." ;
