concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zg-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZG(4) Eligible services—related activities to be carried on on a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zg-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (2) or (3); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (2) or (3); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (2) or (3); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (2) or (3). Civil penalty provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(4) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (2) or (3); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (2) or (3); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (2) or (3); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (2) or (3). Civil penalty provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e7f7ba9706f3d3dda7964d68679c56283b778e240976509fee0775ac9290b5be" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zg ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person must not aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (2) or (3);" ;
