doc:sch-2-sec-151zh-ss-2a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "151ZH(2A) Statement about the differences between an access" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2A) If:  (a) a person offers to supply eligible services to the person’s wholesale customers, or prospective wholesale customers, using a local access line; and  (b) any of the following conditions is satisfied:  (i) section 142C applies to the line;  (ii) section 143 applies to the line;  (iii) neither section 142C nor section 143 applies to the line, and there is in force a functional separation undertaking that relates to local access line services supplied, or proposed to be supplied, using the line; the person must publish on the person’s website:  (c) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price; or  (d) other terms and conditions; on which the person offers to supply eligible services to the person’s wholesale customers, or prospective wholesale customers, using the line.  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  Ancillary contraventions" ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zh-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZH(3) Statement about the differences between an access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zh-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1), (2) or (2A); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1), (2) or (2A); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1), (2) or (2A); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1), (2) or (2A). Civil penalty provisions" ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1), (2) or (2A); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (1), (2) or (2A); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (1), (2) or (2A); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (1), (2) or (2A). Civil penalty provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "704633c662dcadc4fbc5a973b15be91192b34d8f222d796c26cde6cc1af4b708" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zh ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Reference to an eligible service was made in a declared service. A person must not aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (1), (2) or (2A);" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
