concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zh-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZH(3) Statement about the differences between an access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zh-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) and section 152BE of that Act to a declared service were a reference to an eligible service; and  (b) subsection 152BE(2) of that Act had not been enacted. 151ZHA  Judicial enforcement of non-discrimination rules" ;
    skos:definition "(3) and section 152BE of that Act to a declared service were a reference to an eligible service; and  (b) subsection 152BE(2) of that Act had not been enacted. 151ZHA  Judicial enforcement of non-discrimination rules"@en ;
