    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zl-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) An application under this section for a review of a decision must be:  (a) in writing; and  (b) in the case of an application under subsection (1), (3), (4) or (5)—made within 21 days after the ACCC made the decision; and  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (c) in the case of an application under subsection (2)—made within 14 days after the ACCC made the decision." ;
    skos:definition "(6) An application under this section for a review of a decision must be:  (a) in writing; and  (b) in the case of an application under subsection (1), (3), (4) or (5)—made within 21 days after the ACCC made the decision; and  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (c) in the case of an application under subsection (2)—made within 14 days after the ACCC made the decision."@en ;
