concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zl-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZL(7) Review by the Australian Competition Tribunal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zl-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If the Australian Competition Tribunal receives an application under this section for a review of a decision, the Australian Competition Tribunal must review the decision." ;
