concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zm-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZM(5) Functions and powers of the Australian Competition"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zm-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) For the purposes of a review by the Australian Competition Tribunal, the member of the Australian Competition Tribunal presiding at the review may require the ACCC to give such information, make such reports and provide such other assistance to the Australian Competition Tribunal as the member specifies." ;
    skos:definition "(5) For the purposes of a review by the Australian Competition Tribunal, the member of the Australian Competition Tribunal presiding at the review may require the ACCC to give such information, make such reports and provide such other assistance to the Australian Competition Tribunal as the member specifies."@en ;
