concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-151zm-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "151ZM(6) Functions and powers of the Australian Competition"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-151zm-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of a review, the Australian Competition Tribunal may have regard to any information given, documents produced or evidence given to the ACCC in connection with the making of the decision to which the review relates." ;
