concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-71 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "71 After subsection 158(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-71 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (2A) Subsection (2) has effect subject to subsection (2B).  (2B) For the purposes of:  (a) section 142C; and  (b) sections 151ZF, 151ZG and 151ZH, to the extent to which they relate to a line to which section 142C applies; and  (c) any other provision of this Part, so far as that provision relates to:  (i) section 142C; or  (ii) section 151ZF, 151ZG or 151ZH, to the extent to which that section relates to a line to which section 142C applies; if a line in a multi-unit building is used to supply a superfast carriage service to a residential customer living in a unit in the building:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (d) the line is taken to be a local access line; and  (e) the line is taken to form part of the infrastructure of a telecommunications network." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (2A) Subsection (2) has effect subject to subsection (2B).  (2B) For the purposes of:  (a) section 142C; and  (b) sections 151ZF, 151ZG and 151ZH, to the extent to which they relate to a line to which section 142C applies; and  (c) any other provision of this Part, so far as that provision relates to:  (i) section 142C; or  (ii) section 151ZF, 151ZG or 151ZH, to the extent to which that section relates to a line to which section 142C applies; if a line in a multi-unit building is used to supply a superfast carriage service to a residential customer living in a unit in the building:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (d) the line is taken to be a local access line; and  (e) the line is taken to form part of the infrastructure of a telecommunications network."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "98"^^xsd:integer ;
