doc:sch-2-sec-161-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "161(2) Extended meaning of residential customer" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on by a partnership, and:  (a) most or all of the work of the business is carried out at the residence of an individual who is:  (i) one of the partners of the partnership; or  (ii) the director, or one of the directors, of a corporation that is one of the partners of the partnership; or  (b) the business does not occupy any premises other than the residence of an individual who is:  Local access lines  Schedule 2  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (i) one of the partners of the partnership; or  (ii) the director, or one of the directors, of a corporation that is one of the partners of the partnership; the partnership, in its capacity as a customer, is taken to be a residential customer. Home-based business carried on by a corporation" ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer .

