concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-161-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "161(4) Extended meaning of residential customer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-161-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on by a trust, and:  (a) most or all of the work of the business is carried out at the residence of an individual who is:  (i) a trustee of the trust; or  (ii) the director, or one of the directors, of a corporation that is a trustee of the trust; or  (b) the business does not occupy any premises other than the residence of an individual who is:  (i) a trustee of the trust; or  (ii) the director, or one of the directors, of a corporation that is a trustee of the trust; a trustee of the trust, in the trustee’s capacity as a customer, is taken to be a residential customer.  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of this Part, if a business is carried on by a trust, and:  (a) most or all of the work of the business is carried out at the residence of an individual who is:  (i) a trustee of the trust; or  (ii) the director, or one of the directors, of a corporation that is a trustee of the trust; or  (b) the business does not occupy any premises other than the residence of an individual who is:  (i) a trustee of the trust; or  (ii) the director, or one of the directors, of a corporation that is a trustee of the trust; a trustee of the trust, in the trustee’s capacity as a customer, is taken to be a residential customer.  Schedule 2  Local access lines  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b84bda4a995f740ee7eb319a82bd8eddecd996f1fc3751b01477c1887e078cc3" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-2-sec-161 ;
    cof:pageNumber "100"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A trustee of a trust is considered a residential customer if most or all work is carried out at their residence." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
