concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 After section 152BCCA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: 152BCCB  Statutory infrastructure provider standards and rules prevail over inconsistent access determinations  An access determination has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with:  (a) a standard determined under section 360U of the Telecommunications Act 1997; or  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3 Amendments  Part 1  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (b) rules made under section 360V of that Act." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: 152BCCB  Statutory infrastructure provider standards and rules prevail over inconsistent access determinations  An access determination has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with:  (a) a standard determined under section 360U of the Telecommunications Act 1997; or  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3 Amendments  Part 1  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (b) rules made under section 360V of that Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d0eb2b001171c998c38c87c62446b8ef7428cc7bc4b0f110244931ce4ea25470" ;
    cof:pageNumber "106"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inconsistent access determinations have no effect to the extent they contradict statutory infrastructure provider standards and rules." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
