concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 After section 152CBIC"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: 152CBID  Statutory infrastructure provider standards and rules prevail over inconsistent special access undertakings  A special access undertaking has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with:  (a) a standard determined under section 360U of the Telecommunications Act 1997; or  (b) rules made under section 360V of that Act. Telecommunications Act 1997" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: 152CBID  Statutory infrastructure provider standards and rules prevail over inconsistent special access undertakings  A special access undertaking has no effect to the extent to which it is inconsistent with:  (a) a standard determined under section 360U of the Telecommunications Act 1997; or  (b) rules made under section 360V of that Act. Telecommunications Act 1997"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "48621b30b4cfea2299e48eae8bfb6ebc510d5e2b81194be3c54a778dd4d32dd4" ;
