concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360 Simplified outline of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-360 ;
    values:originalText "• The statutory infrastructure provider for a service area must, on reasonable request by a carriage service provider on behalf of an end-user at premises in the service area, connect the premises to a qualifying telecommunications network in order that the carriage service provider can provide qualifying carriage services to the end-user at the premises. • A statutory infrastructure provider must comply with standards, benchmarks and rules determined by the Minister. • A statutory infrastructure provider must publish the terms and conditions on which it offers to:  (a) connect premises; or  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3 Amendments  Part 1  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (b) supply related eligible services to carriage service providers." ;
    skos:definition "• The statutory infrastructure provider for a service area must, on reasonable request by a carriage service provider on behalf of an end-user at premises in the service area, connect the premises to a qualifying telecommunications network in order that the carriage service provider can provide qualifying carriage services to the end-user at the premises. • A statutory infrastructure provider must comply with standards, benchmarks and rules determined by the Minister. • A statutory infrastructure provider must publish the terms and conditions on which it offers to:  (a) connect premises; or  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3 Amendments  Part 1  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (b) supply related eligible services to carriage service providers."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a39b8b3da4cdc5f890f7a8a64648c03cc337dc81017373d92999e6da884d0a69" ;
    cof:pageNumber "108"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must connect premises to a qualifying telecommunications network" ;
    dc:description "Qualifying carriage services to the end-user at the premises" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020.pdf, p.108" ;
