concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360d-ss-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360D(11) Interim NBN service area"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-360d-ss-11 ;
    values:originalText "(11) Before making a decision under subsection (9) to vary a declaration, the Minister must:  (a) cause to be published on the Department’s website a notice:  (i) setting out the draft variation; and  (ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the Minister about the draft variation within the time limit specified in the notice; and  (b) consider any submissions received within the time limit specified in the notice." ;
    skos:definition "(11) Before making a decision under subsection (9) to vary a declaration, the Minister must:  (a) cause to be published on the Department’s website a notice:  (i) setting out the draft variation; and  (ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the Minister about the draft variation within the time limit specified in the notice; and  (b) consider any submissions received within the time limit specified in the notice."@en ;
