concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360E Statutory infrastructure provider for an interim NBN service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-360e ;
    values:originalText "area  For the purposes of the application of this Part before the designated day, if:  (a) an area is a provisional interim NBN service area because of a section 360D declaration made by NBN Co; and  (b) the whole or a part of the provisional interim NBN service area is an interim NBN service area; NBN Co is the statutory infrastructure provider for the interim NBN service area. Subdivision B—Rules applicable after the start of the designated day" ;
    skos:definition "area  For the purposes of the application of this Part before the designated day, if:  (a) an area is a provisional interim NBN service area because of a section 360D declaration made by NBN Co; and  (b) the whole or a part of the provisional interim NBN service area is an interim NBN service area; NBN Co is the statutory infrastructure provider for the interim NBN service area. Subdivision B—Rules applicable after the start of the designated day"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "34385eabe2bd773ea2301906cdbe60cdedf2b9b8fa7d1e4dbf5b8753f33af9f7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "116"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "NBN Co is statutory infrastructure provider for interim NBN service area if provisional interim NBN service area declared by section 360D declaration." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
