concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360G Statutory infrastructure provider for the general service area"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-360g ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of the application of this Part after the start of the designated day, NBN Co is the statutory infrastructure provider for the general service area.  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3 Amendments  Part 1  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  Subdivision C—Rules applicable before, at and after the start of the designated day" ;
