doc:sch-3-sec-360ha-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "360HA(2) Nominated service area—anticipatory notice to be given to" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If:  (a) before the commencement of this section, a carrier (other than an NBN corporation) entered into a contract for the installation of telecommunications network infrastructure that will enable the supply of eligible services to premises in the whole of the project area of a real estate development project; and  (b) the installation was not completed before the commencement of this section; and  (c) when the installation is completed, the carrier will be required, by subsection 360H(2), to declare that the whole of the project area is a provisional nominated service area for the purposes of this Part; the carrier must:  (d) give the ACMA a written notice that:  (i) states that the carrier has entered into the contract; and  (ii) specifies the project area; and  Schedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc." ;
    cof:pageNumber "120"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360j a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360J Nominated service area—carrier licence conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-360j ;
    values:originalText "declarations  For the purposes of this Part, if, immediately before the commencement of this section, a carrier licence held by a carrier was subject to a condition under any of the following declarations in relation to a development area (within the meaning of the declaration):  (a) the Carrier Licence Conditions (OptiComm Co Pty Ltd) Declaration 2013;  (b) the Carrier Licence Conditions (Pivit Pty Ltd) Declaration 2013;  (c) the Carrier Licence Conditions (NT Technology Services Pty Ltd) Declaration 2014;  Schedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc." ;
    skos:definition "declarations  For the purposes of this Part, if, immediately before the commencement of this section, a carrier licence held by a carrier was subject to a condition under any of the following declarations in relation to a development area (within the meaning of the declaration):  (a) the Carrier Licence Conditions (OptiComm Co Pty Ltd) Declaration 2013;  (b) the Carrier Licence Conditions (Pivit Pty Ltd) Declaration 2013;  (c) the Carrier Licence Conditions (NT Technology Services Pty Ltd) Declaration 2014;  Schedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "efe97ab9c6b31605e313d8a572d0908aff0e83f1cfb093fca4844b45f3a0a80d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "123"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "List of declarations subject to condition before commencement" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
