doc:sch-3-sec-360k-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "360K(2) Statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service area" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:  (a) subsection (1) does not apply to a specified nominated service area; and  (b) a specified carrier is the statutory infrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the purposes of this Part. Nominated service area resulting from the application of section 360J" ;
