doc:sch-3-sec-360q-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "360Q(1) Obligation of statutory infrastructure provider to supply" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The statutory infrastructure provider for a service area must, on reasonable request by a carriage service provider:  (a) supply an eligible service to the carriage service provider in order that the carriage service provider can provide qualifying carriage services to end-users at premises in the service area; and  (b) do so on the terms and conditions that were published on the statutory infrastructure provider’s website at the time when the request was made. Note: For publication, see section 360X." ;
    cof:pageNumber "129"^^xsd:integer .

