concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360x a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360X Publication of offer—supply of eligible services"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-360x ;
    values:originalText "(1) A statutory infrastructure provider for a service area must publish on its website:  (a) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price; and  (b) other terms and conditions; on which it offers to supply eligible services to carriage service providers in order that the carriage service providers can provide  Schedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A statutory infrastructure provider for a service area must publish on its website:  (a) the terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price; and  (b) other terms and conditions; on which it offers to supply eligible services to carriage service providers in order that the carriage service providers can provide  Schedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c63fe919c59251cb4264e6cbfcd12d90b99993ea271e23eb7b328d9a53e11a20" ;
    cof:pageNumber "137"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Publish terms and conditions on website" ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
