doc:sch-3-sec-360xa-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "360XA(4) Periodic compliance reports" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, in the case of an individual:  (a) the report; or  Statutory infrastructure providers etc.  Schedule 3 Amendments  Part 1  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (b) giving the report; or  (c) any information, document or thing obtained as a direct or indirect consequence of giving the report; is not admissible in evidence against the individual:  (d) in civil proceedings for the recovery of a penalty; or  (e) in criminal proceedings (other than proceedings for an offence against section 137.1 or 137.2 of the Criminal Code that relates to the report). Other information-gathering powers not limited" ;
    cof:pageNumber "138"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360xa-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360XA(5) Periodic compliance reports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-360xa-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) This section does not, by implication, limit Part 27." ;
