concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360Y Building redevelopment projects etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-360y ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a project is a building redevelopment project if:  (a) the project involves:  (i) the significant refurbishment or repurposing of one or more buildings so as to bring into existence one or more building units; and  (ii) the making available of any or all of those building units for sale or lease; and  (b) the conditions (if any) specified in an instrument under subsection (3) are satisfied.  (2) For the purposes of this Part, the area or areas occupied by the building or buildings are the project area for the building redevelopment project.  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, specify conditions for the purposes of paragraph (1)(b).  (4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:  (a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in stages; or  (b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will be, carried out by different persons; or  Schedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Part, a project is a building redevelopment project if:  (a) the project involves:  (i) the significant refurbishment or repurposing of one or more buildings so as to bring into existence one or more building units; and  (ii) the making available of any or all of those building units for sale or lease; and  (b) the conditions (if any) specified in an instrument under subsection (3) are satisfied.  (2) For the purposes of this Part, the area or areas occupied by the building or buildings are the project area for the building redevelopment project.  (3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, specify conditions for the purposes of paragraph (1)(b).  (4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether:  (a) the project has been, is being, or will be, implemented in stages; or  (b) different elements of the project have been, are being, or will be, carried out by different persons; or  Schedule 3  Statutory infrastructure providers etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "692c7f50d3b7e415a2d0e3024541cd7c4a84c248c35b43a4c7ac7736592dfbaf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "139"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360y-ss-3 ;
