concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-3-sec-360za-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "360ZA(3) Delegation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-360za-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Minister may, by writing, delegate to:  (a) a member of the ACMA; or  (b) a person who is:  (i) a member of the staff of the ACMA; and  (ii) an SES employee or acting SES employee; any or all of the Minister’s powers under subsection 360H(14) (variation of nominated service area declaration)." ;
