doc:sch-4-sec-8 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "8 Section 4" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Before: • Local calls are to be charged for on an untimed basis. insert: • The Secretary is responsible for entering into contracts, and making grants, relating to:  (a) fixed wireless broadband; and  (b) satellite broadband. • The ACMA will assess and collect the charge imposed on carriers by the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020. • The proceeds of the charge will be used to:  (a) pay contractors and grant recipients; and  (b) offset designated administrative costs." ;
    cof:pageNumber "146"^^xsd:integer .

