doc:sch-4-sec-76aa-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "76AA(2) Designated broadband services" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine one or more classes of carriage service for the purposes of paragraph (1)(f). Note: See also section 102ZFB (disallowance of determinations)." ;
