concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-78a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78A Financial year"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-78a ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Part (other than section 85), the 6-month period beginning on the designated start date is taken to be a financial year.  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020" ;
