concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-79a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79A Premises"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-79a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if a location satisfies one or more specified conditions, the location is taken to be premises for the purposes of this Part. Note: See also section 102ZFB (disallowance of determinations).  (2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if a location satisfies one or more specified conditions, the location is taken not to be premises for the purposes of this Part. Note: See also section 102ZFB (disallowance of determinations).  (3) A determination under subsection (1) or (2) must be of a legislative character." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if a location satisfies one or more specified conditions, the location is taken to be premises for the purposes of this Part. Note: See also section 102ZFB (disallowance of determinations).  (2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if a location satisfies one or more specified conditions, the location is taken not to be premises for the purposes of this Part. Note: See also section 102ZFB (disallowance of determinations).  (3) A determination under subsection (1) or (2) must be of a legislative character."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1a3259763275804746f31b54dd330db20ec5b923050a6b3fed6268df989172dd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "155"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-79a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-79a-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-79a-ss-3 ;
