concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-80-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80(7) Contracts and grants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-80-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) To avoid doubt, the use of the word “Regional” in:  (a) the short title of the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020; or  (b) the name of the Regional Broadband Scheme Special Account; or  (c) section 92A; does not limit subsection (1) of this section." ;
