concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-82-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "82(7) Condition about compliance with Ministerial determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-82-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) Despite subsection (6), a determination under subsection (2) has no effect to the extent to which it overrides a term or condition:  (a) of a contract entered into under section 80; and  (b) that gives the contractor a right to adjustment of payment for a change in the services, facilities or customer equipment to be supplied by the contractor in accordance with the contract." ;
    skos:definition "(7) Despite subsection (6), a determination under subsection (2) has no effect to the extent to which it overrides a term or condition:  (a) of a contract entered into under section 80; and  (b) that gives the contractor a right to adjustment of payment for a change in the services, facilities or customer equipment to be supplied by the contractor in accordance with the contract."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ff10a99e91edf1e3c9c6286bfd62e05705f41b2af6f64b0f9f67b503ce1ac544" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-82 ;
    cof:pageNumber "157"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Contractor's right to adjustment of payment for change in services, facilities or customer equipment." ;
