concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-82-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "82(8) Condition about compliance with Ministerial determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-82-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) Despite subsection (6), a determination under subsection (2) has no effect to the extent to which it specifies the price, or a method of ascertaining the price, for any of the services, facilities or customer equipment to be supplied by a contractor in accordance with a section 80 contract." ;
