concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-95-ss-2 cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-95-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4 .
