doc:sch-4-sec-95-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "95(4) Exempt premises—small networks" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), the question of whether a person is in a position to exercise control of:  (a) a local access line; or  (b) a telecommunications network; is to be determined in the same manner in which that question is determined for the purposes of Part 8 of the Telecommunications Act 1997." ;
    cof:pageNumber "167"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-95-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "95(5) Exempt premises—small networks"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-95-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) For the purposes of subsection (3), the question of whether a person has one or more associates is to be determined in the same manner in which that question is determined for the purposes of Part 8 of the Telecommunications Act 1997." ;
    skos:definition "(5) For the purposes of subsection (3), the question of whether a person has one or more associates is to be determined in the same manner in which that question is determined for the purposes of Part 8 of the Telecommunications Act 1997."@en ;
