doc:sch-4-sec-96-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "96(4) Exempt lines—local access lines transitioning to the NBN" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, specify one or more agreements for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(e)(iv).  Schedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  Other networks" ;
