concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-96-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "96(10) Exempt lines—local access lines transitioning to the NBN"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-96-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) For the purposes of this section, listed Optus company means:  (a) Optus Networks Pty Limited (ACN 008 570 330); or  (b) Optus Internet Pty Limited (ACN 083 164 532); or  (c) Optus Vision Pty Limited (ACN 066 518 821); or  (d) Optus Vision Media Pty Limited (ACN 070 870 647); or  (e) Optus Systems Pty Limited (ACN 056 541 167); or  (f) SingTel Optus Pty Limited (ACN 052 833 208)." ;
    skos:definition "(10) For the purposes of this section, listed Optus company means:  (a) Optus Networks Pty Limited (ACN 008 570 330); or  (b) Optus Internet Pty Limited (ACN 083 164 532); or  (c) Optus Vision Pty Limited (ACN 066 518 821); or  (d) Optus Vision Media Pty Limited (ACN 070 870 647); or  (e) Optus Systems Pty Limited (ACN 056 541 167); or  (f) SingTel Optus Pty Limited (ACN 052 833 208)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d71e1c7a9860acc5af24c41668f7d8018f7083c5b7b2a4793d41b50495472642" ;
