doc:sch-4-sec-96b-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "96B(2) Recently connected greenfield premises" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If:  (a) a person is a carrier; and  (b) during a period comprising the whole or a part of a month in an eligible financial year, the person supplies an eligible local bitstream access service using a local access line; and  (c) during a whole or a part of that period, a carriage service provider supplies a designated broadband service to one or more premises using the line; and  (d) one or more of those premises are potentially chargeable premises in relation to the person for that month; each of the potentially chargeable premises mentioned in paragraph (d) are recently connected greenfield premises in relation to the person for that month." ;
    cof:pageNumber "171"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-96b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "96B(3) Recently connected greenfield premises"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-96b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In this section: eligible local bitstream access service means a local bitstream access service that is first supplied at a time during the period:  (a) beginning at the start of 1 January 2011; and  (b) ending at the end of 30 June 2019. local bitstream access service has the meaning given by a declaration that:  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) was made:  (i) under subsection 152AL(3) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; and  (ii) in compliance with repealed subsection 152AL(3C) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; and  (b) was in force immediately before the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020." ;
    skos:definition "(3) In this section: eligible local bitstream access service means a local bitstream access service that is first supplied at a time during the period:  (a) beginning at the start of 1 January 2011; and  (b) ending at the end of 30 June 2019. local bitstream access service has the meaning given by a declaration that:  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (a) was made:  (i) under subsection 152AL(3) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; and  (ii) in compliance with repealed subsection 152AL(3C) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; and  (b) was in force immediately before the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6cc0557d8f0ffd87e4c7a84d6e0175dd9a129716deb72d2f3ae840762b4574e5" ;
