concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-97-ss-4a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "97(4A) Anti-avoidance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-97-ss-4a ;
    values:originalText "(4A) A carrier commits an offence if:  (a) the carrier, either alone or together with one or more other persons, enters into, begins to carry out or carries out a scheme; and  (b) the carrier did so for the sole or dominant purpose of obtaining the benefit of section 20 of the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020 in relation to:  (i) the carrier; or  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (ii) any other carrier. Penalty: 10,000 penalty units. Validity of transactions" ;
    skos:definition "(4A) A carrier commits an offence if:  (a) the carrier, either alone or together with one or more other persons, enters into, begins to carry out or carries out a scheme; and  (b) the carrier did so for the sole or dominant purpose of obtaining the benefit of section 20 of the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020 in relation to:  (i) the carrier; or  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (ii) any other carrier. Penalty: 10,000 penalty units. Validity of transactions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "94e0846e11802d828f83b06f9def6fe5810949fd4451ab063104618a6447afb1" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-97 ;
    cof:pageNumber "173"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Entering into a scheme to obtain benefit from section 20 of the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020 is prohibited." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
