doc:sch-4-sec-100-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "100(6) Reporting obligations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) If:  (a) the report relates to:  Schedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  (i) the first eligible financial year; or  (ii) the second eligible financial year; or  (iii) the third eligible financial year; or  (iv) the fourth eligible financial year; or  (v) the fifth eligible financial year; and  (b) during the whole or a part of a month in the eligible financial year, the person was the controller of an associated group; the report must:  (c) set out a statement to that effect; and  (d) identify each of the members of the associated group; and  (e) set out the circumstances that resulted in the person being the controller of the associated group. Associated group" ;
    cof:pageNumber "178"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "100(7) Reporting obligations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-100-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), if:  (a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:  (i) a local access line; or  (ii) a telecommunications network; and  (b) the person has one or more associates; then:  (c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and  (d) the associated group consists of the person and those associates; and  (e) the person is the controller of the associated group." ;
    skos:definition "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), if:  (a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:  (i) a local access line; or  (ii) a telecommunications network; and  (b) the person has one or more associates; then:  (c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and  (d) the associated group consists of the person and those associates; and  (e) the person is the controller of the associated group."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f3d28a11a819d38b415cf3c1021349d5ebee7fd19cf4fca84780dce29d08e70f" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100 ;
    cof:pageNumber "178"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Person must report control of local access line or telecommunications network if they have associates." ;
