doc:sch-4-sec-100-ss-10 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "100(10) Reporting obligations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(10) If:  (a) the report relates to:  (i) the first eligible financial year; or  (ii) the second eligible financial year; or  (iii) the third eligible financial year; or  (iv) the fourth eligible financial year; or  (v) the fifth eligible financial year; and  (b) there are one or more recently connected greenfield premises in relation to the person for a month in the eligible financial year; the report must set out the total number of recently connected greenfield premises in relation to the person for that month." ;
