concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-102c-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102C(10) ACMA may accept statements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-102c-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) If a person is an eligible funding recipient, the administrative cost instalment of charge payable by the person in relation to a financial year becomes due and payable on:  (a) the standard due date for the financial year; or  (b) if the ACMA, by written notice given to the person, allows a later day—that later day.  Schedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(10) If a person is an eligible funding recipient, the administrative cost instalment of charge payable by the person in relation to a financial year becomes due and payable on:  (a) the standard due date for the financial year; or  (b) if the ACMA, by written notice given to the person, allows a later day—that later day.  Schedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020"@en ;
