concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-102h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102H Onus of establishing incorrectness of assessment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-102h ;
    values:originalText "In any proceeding, the onus of establishing that an assessment under section 102 is incorrect is on the party making that assertion." ;
    skos:definition "In any proceeding, the onus of establishing that an assessment under section 102 is incorrect is on the party making that assertion."@en ;
