concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-102k a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102K Cancellation of certain exemptions from charge"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-102k ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section cancels the effect of a provision of another Act that would have the effect of exempting a person from liability to pay charge.  (2) The cancellation does not apply if the provision of the other Act is enacted after the commencement of this section and refers specifically to charge imposed by the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020.  Schedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section cancels the effect of a provision of another Act that would have the effect of exempting a person from liability to pay charge.  (2) The cancellation does not apply if the provision of the other Act is enacted after the commencement of this section and refers specifically to charge imposed by the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020.  Schedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2048b83facc22ce48f3f1f195fffa7eb4b6efe2f74b3d04bd304362dc74ba06c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "187"^^xsd:integer ;
