concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-102n-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102N(5) Late payment penalty"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-102n-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Late payment penalty:  (a) is a debt due to the ACMA on behalf of the Commonwealth; and  (b) may be recovered by the ACMA, on behalf of the Commonwealth, in:  (i) the Federal Court; or  (ii) the Federal Circuit Court; or  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (iii) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation to the matter." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Late payment penalty:  (a) is a debt due to the ACMA on behalf of the Commonwealth; and  (b) may be recovered by the ACMA, on behalf of the Commonwealth, in:  (i) the Federal Court; or  (ii) the Federal Circuit Court; or  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020  (iii) a court of a State or Territory that has jurisdiction in relation to the matter."@en ;
