doc:sch-4-sec-102x-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "102X(3) ACCC may retain documents" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The certified copy must be received in all courts and tribunals as evidence as if it were the original." ;
    cof:pageNumber "193"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-102x-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102X(4) ACCC may retain documents"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-102x-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Until a certified copy is supplied, the ACCC must, at such times and places as the ACCC thinks appropriate, permit the eligible funding recipient otherwise entitled to possession of the document, or a person authorised by that eligible funding recipient, to inspect and make copies of, or take extracts from, the document." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Until a certified copy is supplied, the ACCC must, at such times and places as the ACCC thinks appropriate, permit the eligible funding recipient otherwise entitled to possession of the document, or a person authorised by that eligible funding recipient, to inspect and make copies of, or take extracts from, the document."@en ;
