concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-1-3-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1(1) July 2019 instead of the designated start date); and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-1-3-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause to be conducted a review of the following matters:  (a) the operation of this Part;  (b) the operation of the remaining provisions of this Act to the extent to which they relate to this Part;  (c) the operation of the Telecommunications Act 1997 to the extent to which that Act relates to this Part;  (d) the operation of the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020;  (e) whether this Part should be amended;  (f) whether the remaining provisions of this Act, to the extent to which they relate to this Part, should be amended;  (g) whether the Telecommunications Act 1997, to the extent to which that Act relates to this Part, should be amended;  (h) whether the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020 should be amended." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must cause to be conducted a review of the following matters:  (a) the operation of this Part;  (b) the operation of the remaining provisions of this Act to the extent to which they relate to this Part;  (c) the operation of the Telecommunications Act 1997 to the extent to which that Act relates to this Part;  (d) the operation of the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020;  (e) whether this Part should be amended;  (f) whether the remaining provisions of this Act, to the extent to which they relate to this Part, should be amended;  (g) whether the Telecommunications Act 1997, to the extent to which that Act relates to this Part, should be amended;  (h) whether the Telecommunications (Regional Broadband Scheme) Charge Act 2020 should be amended."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "da80dcb91772a385b217cf7028f7900be48dd8d70c408c94e4185bd842f1da89" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-1-3 ;
    cof:pageNumber "199"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Review of matters related to this Part and its amendments Disallowance of determinations made under subsections 76AA(2) or 79A(1) or (2)" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
