concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-102zg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102ZG Delegation by the Secretary"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-102zg ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Secretary may, by writing, delegate any or all of the Secretary’s functions or powers under this Part to an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Department. Note: The expressions SES employee and acting SES employee are defined in the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  (2) A delegate must comply with any written directions of the Secretary.  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Secretary may, by writing, delegate any or all of the Secretary’s functions or powers under this Part to an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Department. Note: The expressions SES employee and acting SES employee are defined in the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  (2) A delegate must comply with any written directions of the Secretary.  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Schedule 4  No. 47, 2020 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020"@en ;
