concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-102zh a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102ZH Meaning of capable"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-102zh ;
    values:originalText "In determining the meaning of the expression capable when used in:  (a) a provision of this Act (other than this Part); or  (b) the Telecommunications Act 1997; disregard the expression technically capable when used in section 76AA.  Schedule 5  NBN Co transparency  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020" ;
    skos:definition "In determining the meaning of the expression capable when used in:  (a) a provision of this Act (other than this Part); or  (b) the Telecommunications Act 1997; disregard the expression technically capable when used in section 76AA.  Schedule 5  NBN Co transparency  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020"@en ;
