concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-5-sec-98b-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "98B(4) Mapping data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-98b-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Within 14 days after the commencement of this section, the Secretary must, by written notice given to NBN Co, direct NBN Co to ensure that mapping data provided by NBN Co under  Schedule 5  NBN Co transparency  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  subsection (1) or (1A) complies with specified requirements in relation to any or all of the following matters:  (a) file format or formats;  (b) mapping specifications;  (c) any other matter that relates to the form of the mapping data." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Within 14 days after the commencement of this section, the Secretary must, by written notice given to NBN Co, direct NBN Co to ensure that mapping data provided by NBN Co under  Schedule 5  NBN Co transparency  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  subsection (1) or (1A) complies with specified requirements in relation to any or all of the following matters:  (a) file format or formats;  (b) mapping specifications;  (c) any other matter that relates to the form of the mapping data."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ab0050bd4a960817fc4821aa14bf4a83743dc36771680449ebfbac8d7b8400d0" ;
